# Patterns are anchored to the context root, so nested directories need the
# **/ prefix: a bare ".env" would keep server/.env and client/.env in the
# build context (and therefore in image layers).
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/build
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/*.log
**/.git
**/.gitignore
**/.vscode
**/.idea
**/*.md
!README.md
**/docker-compose*.yml
**/Dockerfile
**/.dockerignore
**/coverage
**/.nyc_output
**/pgdata
video
docs

artifacts
**/test-results*
**/playwright-report*
scripts/provider-fixtures.cjs
